:: Gabe Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> break out laughing at a random joke he tells out of nowhere. <span style="color:LightGreen">Sometimes you forget that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> can be pretty funny when he isn’t being a teasing jerk.</span> It is actually nice to be around him when he’s like this. Sadly, you realize that your hang out session has to come to an end and tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> thus. <span style="color:LightGreen">He raises an eyebrow at you, smirking.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Gabe",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh? What? Too cool to hang out with your, honestly much cooler and more handsome, big brother? Got a hot date or something?”</span> He laughs, lightly punching you in the arm. You chuckle and explain that you just have some other stuff you have to do, but you did have fun hanging out with him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, don’t tell anyone I said this, but I had fun too. A bit. You’re not COMPLETELY a dork all the time, I guess. I’ll head home then, try not to do anything too crazy without me, hm?”</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Ask for a hug goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        As he begins to walk away, you clear your throat. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> turns around curiously and sees you standing there with your arms outstretched, silently asking for a hug goodbye. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Really?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> asks, rolling his eyes. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whatever. Guess you are still my BABY brother after all.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You let his teasing insult slide as he walks over and gives you a hug…</span> <span style="color:Pink">that ends with an attempt at a wedgie that you barely escape from.</span> <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Gabe",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        You chuckle and jump back as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> laughs and heads off. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Try not to get into any trouble!”</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Stick your tongue out at him<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> walks away, his back to you, you do what any little brother would. <span style="color:LightGreen">You stick your tongue out at him and make all sorts of teasing and rude motions.</span> Though despite his back being to you, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> seems to sense what you are doing and quickly spins around. You jump in surprise and quickly try to pretend you weren’t doing anything. <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Gabe",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Watch it kid.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> laughs with an amused smirk, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Or else you may be attending your next playdate in your birthday suit.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You blush at his threat as he walks off, carefully peeking over his shoulder a few times to ensure you aren’t doing anything. What a guy.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>